THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS & MODELS

This software depends on various third-party libraries and AI models as described below.

LGPLv3 Components:
- PyQt6 (https://www.qt.io/licensing/) - LGPL v3.0

BSD/Permissive Components:
- PyTorch (BSD-style compatible)
- Pillow (BSD 3-Clause)
- NumPy, SciPy (BSD 3-Clause)
- Matplotlib (BSD-style)

Apache 2.0 Components:
- Hugging Face Transformers (Apache 2.0)
- Diffusers Library (Apache 2.0)

AI MODEL DOWNLOADS

This application does NOT include AI models in the source repository. 
Models are downloaded at runtime from external sources (e.g., Hugging Face).

Each model is subject to its own license terms, which may differ from 
this software's MIT license. Users downloading or using these models must 
comply with each model's specific licensing requirements independently.

Example of downloadable models:
- Stable Diffusion SD1.5: CreativeML Open RAIL-M
  https://stability.ai/text-to-image-models-license

Users are solely responsible for ensuring their use complies with each 
model's license terms. This software is distributed under MIT License only.